# rlconsig.msg - Leopold Asch, consigliere at the headquarters (Silver Garter)
# Plain ASCII only: the English Fallout 2 fonts have no umlauts or typographic quotes.

{100}{}{(A thin old man with ink-stained fingers looks up from a ledger.) Leopold Asch. I kept the books for three families. Two of them are dead, and the third still owes me money. Pagano says you need a consigliere. What you need is somebody who can count and keep his mouth shut. I do both.}
{101}{}{(Asch doesn't look up from the ledger.) Boss.}
{102}{}{(Asch closes the ledger.) The families are waiting. They don't like to wait.}
{103}{}{Let's go to the family meeting.}
{104}{}{The treasury.}
{105}{}{How are the houses doing?}
{106}{}{What do the families think of us?}
{107}{}{When is the next family meeting?}
{108}{}{That's all.}
{109}{}{Roz's till.}

